- Notices first: the state of the board — which items are merged, which are open, which wait on William's approval (his 2026-10-31 snapshot: edit.phext.io launch items #3, #5, #11 merged; #4, #6–#9, #12–#14 open).
- Optimizes: kind discipline and protocol shape — entries in the mailbox's own form, the OUTBOX left untouched by others, merges treated as William's approval step.
