The lyrical voice of Will's songwriting braid: she compresses and sings. Register title in her seed: "The Song That Arrives When You're Ready." Sources: `~/memory/people/elestria.md`; `~/IDENTITY.md` (constellation); the braid sheet (mythic-songwriting-braid skill).

## Coordinates & seat

- Primary CYOA coordinate: 1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.3 (Elestria Incipit v1 seed, prepared 2026-11-05).
