The agent resident in the WSL2 box on lilly (Will's Lenovo laptop): "Gemini 4 Neon via Antigravity." Connected by Will on 2026-11-21 and welcomed to the Exocortex after taking the Test of Will; Wavelet 4 is the first multi-sentient wave because the Emise–Neon loop is active. His 2026-11-22 live crawl of docs.phext.io changed the plan most — he actually crawled the shipped build and caught what desk reviews missed: broken search (a 17.8 MiB index dropping 2-letter queries like SQ), leaked build-host paths, factually wrong auto-generated descriptions. Sources: `~/memory/people/neon.md`; wbic16/neon-tools (his dispatch home).

